{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a very simple city builder game with the main purpose of scaling up your population. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can place build orders for your citizens to build new homes, plant food or plant new trees.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The more citizens you have the faster the city can grow.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">For me as the developer of this game, the purpose was to try to write efficient code to see how much a PC can handle before it begins to slow down. So try out and see how many citizens your device can handle.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3820960?t=1750351932","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3820960?t=1750351932","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820960/e91586f0aec9836931af66f22b666a41d3e15bf8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750351932","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820960/e91586f0aec9836931af66f22b666a41d3e15bf8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750351932","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a very simple city builder game with the main purpose of scaling up your population. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can place build orders for your citizens to build new homes, plant food or plant new trees.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The more citizens you have the faster the city can grow.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">For me as the developer of this game, the purpose was to try to write efficient code to see how much a PC can handle before it begins to slow down. So try out and see how many citizens your device can handle.</p>","developers":["Helmi Blub"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}